  Test identifier                     Unique label for the test run

  Preconditions                       Account state, roles, MFA status,
                                      tokens, object state

  Execution mode                      Sequential or concurrent;
                                      synchronization method

  Request pair/group                  Endpoint and method, with secrets
                                      removed

  Response evidence                   Status, relevant headers, body
                                      differences, redirect

